## Completion

A created or retrofitted harness is ready when the reviewed model is present, every referenced
ID resolves, unresolved decisions block the correct features, every confirmed/inferred
acceptance criterion has a verification plan, and the local validator runs before engineering
checks. Real effectiveness still requires domain review and representative before/after agent
sessions.
